{
~A. Use a louder voice so the audience agrees#This confuses delivery volume with persuasive planning. A strong speech still needs a clear claim, evidence, reasoning, and audience awareness.
=B. Show how the evidence directly supports the claim#Correct. This answer directly supports the lesson skill by using the standard to make communication clearer, better supported, and more audience aware.
